{"page":495,"verses":[{"verse_key":"43:74","surah":43,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ فِى عَذَابِ جَهَنَّمَ خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But the evildoers will remain in Hell’s punishment,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"43:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","en_gloss":"the criminals","transliteration":"l-muj'rimīna","verse_key":"43:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(will be) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"43:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَذَابِ","en_gloss":"(the) punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābi","verse_key":"43:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"43:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_gloss":"abiding forever","transliteration":"khālidūna","verse_key":"43:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٧٤","en_gloss":"(74)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:74"}]},{"verse_key":"43:75","surah":43,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يُفَتَّرُ عَنْهُمْ وَهُمْ فِيهِ مُبْلِسُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"from which there is no relief: they will remain in utter despair.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"43:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُفَتَّرُ","en_gloss":"will it subside","transliteration":"yufattaru","verse_key":"43:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"43:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"43:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"43:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُبْلِسُونَ","en_gloss":"(will) despair","transliteration":"mub'lisūna","verse_key":"43:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٧٥","en_gloss":"(75)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:75"}]},{"verse_key":"43:76","surah":43,"ayah":76,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ وَلَـٰكِن كَانُوا۟ هُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We never wronged them; they were the ones who did wrong.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"43:76"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We wronged them","transliteration":"ẓalamnāhum","verse_key":"43:76"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"43:76"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"43:76"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"43:76"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"43:76"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٧٦","en_gloss":"(76)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:76"}]},{"verse_key":"43:77","surah":43,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"وَنَادَوْا۟ يَـٰمَـٰلِكُ لِيَقْضِ عَلَيْنَا رَبُّكَ ۖ قَالَ إِنَّكُم مَّـٰكِثُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will cry, ‘Malik, if only your Lord would finish us off,’ but he will answer, ‘No! You are here to stay.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَنَادَوْا۟","en_gloss":"And they will call","transliteration":"wanādaw","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰمَـٰلِكُ","en_gloss":"O Malik","transliteration":"yāmāliku","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِيَقْضِ","en_gloss":"Let put an end","transliteration":"liyaqḍi","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبُّكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He (will) say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّكُم","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innakum","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّـٰكِثُونَ","en_gloss":"(will) remain","transliteration":"mākithūna","verse_key":"43:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٧٧","en_gloss":"(77)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:77"}]},{"verse_key":"43:78","surah":43,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ جِئْنَـٰكُم بِٱلْحَقِّ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَكُمْ لِلْحَقِّ كَـٰرِهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have brought you the Truth but most of you despise it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جِئْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"We have brought you","transliteration":"ji'nākum","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَكْثَرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"most of you","transliteration":"aktharakum","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"to the truth","transliteration":"lil'ḥaqqi","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَـٰرِهُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) averse","transliteration":"kārihūna","verse_key":"43:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٧٨","en_gloss":"(78)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:78"}]},{"verse_key":"43:79","surah":43,"ayah":79,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ أَبْرَمُوٓا۟ أَمْرًا فَإِنَّا مُبْرِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have these disbelievers thought up some scheme? We too have been scheming.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"43:79"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَبْرَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"have they determined","transliteration":"abramū","verse_key":"43:79"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْرًۭا","en_gloss":"an affair","transliteration":"amran","verse_key":"43:79"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"Then indeed, We","transliteration":"fa-innā","verse_key":"43:79"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُبْرِمُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) determined","transliteration":"mub'rimūna","verse_key":"43:79"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٧٩","en_gloss":"(79)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:79"}]},{"verse_key":"43:80","surah":43,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ يَحْسَبُونَ أَنَّا لَا نَسْمَعُ سِرَّهُمْ وَنَجْوَىٰهُم ۚ بَلَىٰ وَرُسُلُنَا لَدَيْهِمْ يَكْتُبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they think We cannot hear their secret talk and their private counsel? Yes we can: Our messengers are at their sides, recording everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْسَبُونَ","en_gloss":"(do) they think","transliteration":"yaḥsabūna","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّا","en_gloss":"that We","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(can) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَسْمَعُ","en_gloss":"hear","transliteration":"nasmaʿu","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سِرَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their secret(s)","transliteration":"sirrahum","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَنَجْوَىٰهُم ۚ","en_gloss":"and their private counsel(s)","transliteration":"wanajwāhum","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"balā","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرُسُلُنَا","en_gloss":"and Our Messengers","transliteration":"warusulunā","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَدَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"ladayhim","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَكْتُبُونَ","en_gloss":"are recording","transliteration":"yaktubūna","verse_key":"43:80"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٠","en_gloss":"(80)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:80"}]},{"verse_key":"43:81","surah":43,"ayah":81,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ إِن كَانَ لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ وَلَدٌ فَأَنَا۠ أَوَّلُ ٱلْعَـٰبِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘If the Lord of Mercy [truly] had offspring I would be the first to worship [them], but-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"had","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"the Most Gracious","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَدٌۭ","en_gloss":"a son","transliteration":"waladun","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَنَا۠","en_gloss":"Then, I","transliteration":"fa-anā","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوَّلُ","en_gloss":"(would be the) first","transliteration":"awwalu","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰبِدِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the worshippers","transliteration":"l-ʿābidīna","verse_key":"43:81"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٨١","en_gloss":"(81)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:81"}]},{"verse_key":"43:82","surah":43,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَ رَبِّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَرْشِ عَمَّا يَصِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"exalted be the Lord of the heavens and earth, the Lord of the Throne- He is far above their false descriptions.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"Glory be","transliteration":"sub'ḥāna","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"(to the) Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"(the) Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْعَرْشِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Throne","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"above what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَصِفُونَ","en_gloss":"they ascribe","transliteration":"yaṣifūna","verse_key":"43:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:82"}]},{"verse_key":"43:83","surah":43,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"فَذَرْهُمْ يَخُوضُوا۟ وَيَلْعَبُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ يُلَـٰقُوا۟ يَوْمَهُمُ ٱلَّذِى يُوعَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Leave them to wade in deeper and play about, until they face the Day they have been promised.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَذَرْهُمْ","en_gloss":"So leave them","transliteration":"fadharhum","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَخُوضُوا۟","en_gloss":"(to) converse vainly","transliteration":"yakhūḍū","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَيَلْعَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and play","transliteration":"wayalʿabū","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُلَـٰقُوا۟","en_gloss":"they meet","transliteration":"yulāqū","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَوْمَهُمُ","en_gloss":"their Day","transliteration":"yawmahumu","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُوعَدُونَ","en_gloss":"they are promised","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","verse_key":"43:83"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٨٣","en_gloss":"(83)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:83"}]},{"verse_key":"43:84","surah":43,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى فِى ٱلسَّمَآءِ إِلَـٰهٌ وَفِى ٱلْأَرْضِ إِلَـٰهٌ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْحَكِيمُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who is God in heaven and God on earth; He is the All Wise, the All Knowing;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the heaven ","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"God","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَفِى","en_gloss":"and in","transliteration":"wafī","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"God","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en_gloss":"the All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"43:84"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:84"}]},{"verse_key":"43:85","surah":43,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"وَتَبَارَكَ ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا وَعِندَهُۥ عِلْمُ ٱلسَّاعَةِ وَإِلَيْهِ تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Exalted is He who has control of the heavens and earth and everything between them; He has knowledge of the Hour; you will all be returned to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَتَبَارَكَ","en_gloss":"And blessed (is)","transliteration":"watabāraka","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who ","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to Whom","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُلْكُ","en_gloss":"(belongs the) dominion","transliteration":"mul'ku","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا","en_gloss":"(is) between both of them","transliteration":"baynahumā","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَعِندَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and with Him","transliteration":"waʿindahu","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِلْمُ","en_gloss":"(is the) knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'mu","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"and to Him","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُرْجَعُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be returned","transliteration":"tur'jaʿūna","verse_key":"43:85"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:85"}]},{"verse_key":"43:86","surah":43,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَمْلِكُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِهِ ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةَ إِلَّا مَن شَهِدَ بِٱلْحَقِّ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those gods they invoke besides Him have no power of intercession, unlike those who bore witness to the truth and recognized it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَمْلِكُ","en_gloss":"have power","transliteration":"yamliku","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"they invoke","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دُونِهِ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةَ","en_gloss":"(for) the intercession","transliteration":"l-shafāʿata","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَهِدَ","en_gloss":"testifies","transliteration":"shahida","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"to the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"43:86"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨٦","en_gloss":"(86)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:86"}]},{"verse_key":"43:87","surah":43,"ayah":87,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَهُمْ لَيَقُولُنَّ ٱللَّهُ ۖ فَأَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you [Prophet] ask them who created them they are sure to say, ‘God,’ so why are they so deluded?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَأَلْتَهُم","en_gloss":"you ask them","transliteration":"sa-altahum","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّنْ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"created them","transliteration":"khalaqahum","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَيَقُولُنَّ","en_gloss":"they will certainly say","transliteration":"layaqūlunna","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"Then how","transliteration":"fa-annā","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤْفَكُونَ","en_gloss":"are they deluded","transliteration":"yu'fakūna","verse_key":"43:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٨٧","en_gloss":"(87)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:87"}]},{"verse_key":"43:88","surah":43,"ayah":88,"ar_uthmani":"وَقِيلِهِۦ يَـٰرَبِّ إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ قَوْمٌ لَّا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Prophet has said, ‘My Lord, truly these are people who do not believe,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقِيلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"And his saying","transliteration":"waqīlihi","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰرَبِّ","en_gloss":"O my Lord","transliteration":"yārabbi","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":4,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"these","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a people","transliteration":"qawmun","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(who do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"43:88"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٨٨","en_gloss":"(88)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"43:88"}]},{"verse_key":"43:89","surah":43,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱصْفَحْ عَنْهُمْ وَقُلْ سَلَـٰمٌ ۚ فَسَوْفَ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but turn away from them and say, ‘Peace’: they will come to know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱصْفَحْ","en_gloss":"So turn away","transliteration":"fa-iṣ'faḥ","v